{{trans-mid}}
{{trans-bottom}}

===Verb===
'''[[intentional]] [[walk]]'''

# {{rfv-sense}} {{baseball}} To give a batter a fourth ball on purpose in order to face the next batter.
#: ''They '''intentionally walked''' Jones as there was a better match-up against Smith.''

